{
    "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
    "annotation": "Main pipeline retains original SpatialData/Scanpy/Squidpy/CellTypist/LIANA outputs; unneeded upper spot filters and redundant gene min_counts=3 are removed. Independent Galaxy Inspect AnnData + Query Tabular evidence outputs: QC before/after filtering; PCA and regressed-PCA total-count correlations; Leiden sizes, adjusted Rand indices, and two resolution crosswalks; CellTypist label frequencies, confidences, and Leiden-label cross-tabulations. Existing Scanpy-ranked gene TSV retained. No arbitrary AnnData uns exporters added; LIANA/Squidpy uns values and modularity/silhouette remain outside evidence coverage. Local SQL verified against historical LIANA h5ad. Galaxy import and jobs: NOT TESTED.",
    "comments": [],
